OL,3,AKilling of six people in Krakow square
OL,4,A'constitutes terrorist offence', says
OL,5,APolish prosecutor
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are continuing to investigate
OL,8,Fafter six people were killed in a
OL,9,Fshooting in Krakow's market square -
OL,10,Fhere's a timeline of what happened
OL,12,FSixteen more people were injured,
OL,13,Fincluding two police officers, five
OL,14,Fforeign nationals and the suspect. Two
OL,15,Fhave now left hospital and others are
OL,16,Fin stable condition, police say
OL,18,FThree other bodies were found at the
OL,19,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,20,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,21,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
