OL,3,AKilling of six people in Krakow square
OL,4,A'constitutes terrorist offence', says
OL,5,APolish prosecutor
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Krakow branch of Poland's National
OL,8,FProsecutor's Office says the shooting
OL,9,Fin the city centre constitutes "a
OL,10,Fterrorist offence"
OL,12,FLate on Saturday, Poland's interior
OL,13,Fminister described the suspect - a
OL,14,FPolish man - as being inspired by
OL,15,F"far-right ideologies"; police said he
OL,16,Fused "military weapons" in the attack
